r/RAG\n47\t  provider surface, and the platform's existing operator and Dashboard\n48\t  integration patterns.\n49\t- Record the decision with rationale, including which downstream conditional\n50\t  branch (managed path or external path) the outcome selects.\n51\t- Obtain stakeholder acceptance of the decision (this is a product posture\n52\t  call, not a purely technical one).\n53\t\n54\tOut of scope: implementing either posture; deciding embedding model selection\n55\tand lifecycle (separate strategy); shipping both postures in the same release.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- A written evaluation exists that compares the platform-managed posture and\n60\t  the external-connection-only posture against explicitly stated criteria:\n61\t  supportability cost, disconnected-environment viability, and\n62\t  time-to-market.\n63\t- The evaluation is grounded in citable evidence (Milvus project\n64\t  characteristics, Llama Stack provider capabilities, platform integration\n65\t  patterns) rather than assertion alone.\n66\t- A single posture decision is recorded with rationale traceable to the\n67\t  evaluation.\n68\t- The recorded decision identifies which conditional downstream branch of\n69\t  work proceeds.\n70\t- Stakeholder sign-off on the decision is recorded.\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- **HLR-1 (P0)**: A decision is reached, with a documented evaluation, on the\n75\t  first supported vector store posture. This epic is the sole coverage for\n76\t  HLR-1.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9675dbf1e0526aff","agent_id":"aa6cd019c2423aa9a","session_id":"124e4662-1fae-4b45-93d6-fde3aa562cb7","uuid":"5a2fcf56-0869-4bac-86e2-59a6d8685bfd","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:54:34.959Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e32149f97c79d86","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
