olded into the\n38\tE001 evaluation itself (same evaluation, same deliverable — not split into a\n39\tseparate investigation).\n40\t\n41\t## Epic List\n42\t\n43\t### Main plan\n44\t\n45\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Component | Priority |\n46\t|----|-------|------|------|-----------|----------|\n47\t| E001 | Decide first supported vector store posture (managed vs external) | Investigation | RHOAI GenAI | Llama Stack | P0 |\n48\t\n49\t### Branch A — platform-managed (operator-deployed Milvus)\n50\t\n51\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Component | Priority |\n52\t|----|-------|------|------|-----------|----------|\n53\t| BRANCH-A-E002 | Onboard Platform Operator midstream repository | Implementation (repo-onboarding) | RHOAI Platform | Platform Operator | P0 |\n54\t| BRANCH-A-E003 | License validation for operator and Milvus dependency trees | Implementation (license-validation) | RHOAI Platform | Platform Operator | P0 |\n55\t| BRANCH-A-E004 | Konflux onboarding for Platform Operator repository | Implementation (konflux-onboarding) | RHOAI Platform | Platform Operator | P0 |\n56\t| BRANCH-A-E005 | Managed vector store deployment via Platform Operator with productized images | Implementation | RHOAI Platform | Platform Operator | P0 |\n57\t| BRANCH-A-E006 | Llama Stack RAG provider wiring for the managed vector store | Implementation | RHOAI GenAI | Llama Stack | P1 |\n58\t| BRANCH-A-E007 | Dashboard deploy-and-manage UI for the managed vector store | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | Dashboard | P1 |\n59\t| BRANCH-A-E008 | Product documentation for the managed vector store posture | Implementation (docs-authoring) | RHOAI Documentation | Documentation | P1 |\n60\t\n61\t### Branch B — external-connection-only\n62\t\n63\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Component | Priority |\n64\t|----|-------|------|------|-----------|----------|\n65\t| BRANCH-B-E002 | Per-project external vector store connection registration and management UI | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | Dashboard