ductized images for the vector store components (no unqualified\n51\t  upstream tags), built through the platform build pipeline.\n52\t- Expose the deployed vector store so that platform components (Llama Stack\n53\t  distributions, Dashboard) can discover and consume it.\n54\t- Provide a clean uninstall/rollback path: removing the managed vector store\n55\t  request tears down the deployment without orphaned resources.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- An administrator can request a managed vector store through the Platform\n60\t  Operator, and the operator provisions a running vector database in the\n61\t  cluster.\n62\t- The deployed vector store is functional: a client can create collections\n63\t  and run vector search against it.\n64\t- All deployed vector store components run productized images with\n65\t  fully-qualified references (no `:latest` or unqualified upstream tags).\n66\t- The operator reconciles the resource: deletion of the request removes the\n67\t  deployment and its dependent resources cleanly.\n68\t- The build pipeline for the Platform Operator repository is green with the\n69\t  vector store changes merged (first pipeline execution gates this epic's\n70\t  completion, not its start).\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- **HLR-2 (P0)** — managed-path clause: \"administrators can deploy the managed\n75\t  vector store through the Platform Operator with productized images.\"\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-981a0a441a33b118","agent_id":"a6e60a1d191b3c305","session_id":"124e4662-1fae-4b45-93d6-fde3aa562cb7","uuid":"c8872fee-43f4-49c1-bc48-529e00e62e2c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:02:26.811Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c188a00cc4f061e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
